<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-03T09:46:53.115Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 09:46:53 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran troops are searching for four missing soldiers after a gang ambush near Port-au-Prince, while President Bukele has deployed 2,000 Salvadoran forces in Haiti and denies any airstrikes. Haitian gang leaders have written to the United Nations seeking mediation and dialogue with security forces, and the UN has confirmed 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP. Benin has pledged 2,000 troops to assist Haiti's anti-gang fight, and the country has graduated 1,189 new officers for security operations. The presidential election has been postponed to July 2027 amid worsening hunger and high food prices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxNcWpBblRQY1dfMzdMb2ZMTmVyZFROc1BqNF9DTXhpVTZsU01FQV9ISnMxaW1yZzJMYzBaeGFUYkhTb2JKTmF3ZXJ1TThFT1BrRVpSVTdTRlFCVkdmTXBNdTl3amM3UTI1MEpkM0lfb3VKYXNzSGFmTmpzZnlKazlPbU1tUkdEWllxMFpkMWl0ZVhDeExrN252NGxMNExFOFhDZ2ZLWHdVRkVxYXpzaDJycnRqSVlSU1hFMjZhSkd6WDBrYkJBMkdOMHI3bjE?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQeFFIaW1Ya0Q0cVFzUkVrYWNQRzBZYktPQlpOVm1yeEVZYzhNT0RJNVdKVGMwbXUtZ1dtZHZBUXI2emF0d0tFSGU5NEoxd1diLUdJSERoNEw0d2twVHpNejI2ZXNzeC0zMGRlcC1BdkQ4MUk1WkNQQklReXF6bml3aGVOOEpmOG40MC1XV3FnLXp1d1JCVXNZRHFlYzVndGlxMFlDaElfU2lzYXRKZ1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOc0swV0Z5MkJuU21TY0xEaEY5QzdsbUFGLVRwYlBDaDA4Znp1VWpjc1prbUloNTc2U3JVbk02LVRGTzB4X3lSaVppbXJ3RWtLanhkcm9GQkdtU0xFR3ZSMWttdmNFSXNxcVZyeDJxWnlTbUhEU2pHNXNROTlCeXlYcGdjY0prSUs2YWtRVTZOSk00R2Y5WHFHajVZUW9rRWtDbTEwcDNscW9wVkZjUlI0czA2V3k4Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPQX